From eeecfdb29b2bf0738ec8cc4fbb99a52bb2e14cc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:35:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(web): React frontend with booking flows and a live
 concurrency race demo

Adds web/ (Vite + React + TypeScript): browse/search events, book and cancel,
create events, my bookings, organizer attendee list, and a race demo that
fires N concurrent bookings at a small event and verifies no overbooking.
Deploys as a Render static site and builds in CI.

